{"id":"a71f13fb7a589809","group":"93","path":"93/93-ax-propositional.md","title":"Propositional","display":"ax-propositional — Propositional","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-ax-propositional","aliases":["93-ax-propositional"],"display":"ax-propositional — Propositional","depends_on":["[[93-df-classical-propositional-calculus]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-ax-propositional"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-ax-propositional</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-propositional — Propositional"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3c8f5c9e577b791\" href=\"?note=e3c8f5c9e577b791\" title=\"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus\">93-df-classical-propositional-calculus</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> is the concrete Hilbert presentation of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e3c8f5c9e577b791\" href=\"?note=e3c8f5c9e577b791\" title=\"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus\">93-df-classical-propositional-calculus</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span> have their source signatures.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}propositional}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\varnothing\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\psi,\\varphi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varnothing\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\psi,\\chi)),\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi),\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\\chi))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varnothing\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\n\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi),\n\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\psi)),\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\n\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi),\\psi),\\varphi)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}propositional}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\varnothing\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\psi,\\varphi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varnothing\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\psi,\\chi)),\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi),\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\\chi))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varnothing\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\n\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi),\n\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\psi)),\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\n\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi),\\psi),\\varphi)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>These are exactly the three schemes included in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>; the implication and negation symbols are typed formula constructors rather than unconstrained ambient maps.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"e3c8f5c9e577b791","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-classical-propositional-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"e3c8f5c9e577b791","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)$ is the concrete Hilbert presentation of [[93-df-classical-propositional-calculus]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\math